Subject: [PATCH] fix(daytona): prevent backend replay and classify recoverable errors

Base-Commit: c3f3d536242c7663cfeecdfbf63670b51630e9aa
Repository: Qredence/fleet-rlm
Reviewed-Fleet-Version: 0.7.10
